Aircrack-ng FZ
===============

This work contains an independently adapted, bounded implementation of on-disk
constants and structure semantics from Aircrack-ng, primarily
include/aircrack-ng/support/pcap_local.h.

Aircrack-ng copyright belongs to its respective contributors, including the
copyright notices retained in the upstream project. Aircrack-ng-derived
material retains its GNU GPL version 2-or-later terms. This repository is
distributed under the compatible GNU GPL version 3 shown in LICENSE.

Flipper-specific application, storage, GUI, NFC, LF RFID, and Sub-GHz code is a
new adaptation. It is not endorsed by the Aircrack-ng or Flipper Devices teams.
It adds no Wi-Fi hardware capability.
